    "body": "\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nPrefer Humming over Marlin for MXFP4 MoE on SM90\r\n\r\nThanks @Missyinlll for catching this issue and for the very detailed testing. So far, Humming has outperformed Marlin in our tests on both H200 and H20.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n\r\n4 * NVIDIA H20-3e\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nvllm serve deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 \\\r\n    --trust-remote-code \\\r\n    --kv-cache-dtype fp8 \\\r\n    --block-size 256 \\\r\n    --enable-expert-parallel \\\r\n    --tensor-parallel-size 4 \\\r\n    --tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4 \\\r\n    --tool-call-parser deepseek_v4 \\\r\n    --enable-auto-tool-choice \\\r\n    --reasoning-parser deepseek_v4 \\\r\n    --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\r\n    --max-num-batched-tokens 16384\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nvllm bench serve \\\r\n    --backend vllm \\\r\n    --base-url http://localhost:8000 \\\r\n    --model deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 \\\r\n    --dataset-name random \\\r\n    --random-input-len 1024 \\\r\n    --random-output-len 64 \\\r\n    --num-prompts 128 \\\r\n    --num-warmups 8 \\\r\n    --request-rate inf \\\r\n    --seed 701\r\n\r\n```\r\n## Test Result\r\nbefore\r\n```\r\n(Worker_TP0_EP0 pid=1697191) INFO 08-14 18:20:57 [mxfp4.py:630] Using 'MARLIN' Mxfp4 MoE backend.\r\n(Worker_TP0_EP0 pid=1697191) INFO 08-14 18:21:07 [mxfp4.py:1826] Using MarlinExperts\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n============ Serving Benchmark Result ============\r\nSuccessful requests:                     128       \r\nFailed requests:                         0         \r\nBenchmark duration (s):                  16.76     \r\nTotal input tokens:                      131072    \r\nTotal generated tokens:                  8192      \r\nRequest throughput (req/s):              7.64      \r\nOutput token throughput (tok/s):         488.76    \r\nPeak output token throughput (tok/s):    3712.00   \r\nPeak concurrent requests:                128.00    \r\nTotal token throughput (tok/s):          8308.98   \r\n---------------Time to First Token----------------\r\nMean TTFT (ms):                          8362.06   \r\nMedian TTFT (ms):                        8379.88   \r\nP99 TTFT (ms):                           14659.30  \r\n-----Time per Output Token (excl. 1st token)------\r\nMean TPOT (ms):                          132.00    \r\nMedian TPOT (ms):                        131.79    \r\nP99 TPOT (ms):                           230.71    \r\n---------------Inter-token Latency----------------\r\nMean ITL (ms):                           132.00    \r\nMedian ITL (ms):                         34.60     \r\nP99 ITL (ms):                            1812.36   \r\n==================================================\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nhumming-kernels 0.1.12\r\n```\r\n(Worker_TP0_EP0 pid=1833984) INFO 08-14 18:28:36 [mxfp4.py:429] Using 'HUMMING' Mxfp4 MoE backend.\r\n(Worker_TP0_EP0 pid=1833984) INFO 08-14 18:28:46 [mxfp4.py:1826] Using HummingIndexedExperts\r\n```\r\n```\r\n============ Serving Benchmark Result ============\r\nSuccessful requests:                     128       \r\nFailed requests:                         0         \r\nBenchmark duration (s):                  13.98     \r\nTotal input tokens:                      131072    \r\nTotal generated tokens:                  8192      \r\nRequest throughput (req/s):              9.16      \r\nOutput token throughput (tok/s):         585.95    \r\nPeak output token throughput (tok/s):    2944.00   \r\nPeak concurrent requests:                128.00    \r\nTotal token throughput (tok/s):          9961.23   \r\n---------------Time to First Token----------------\r\nMean TTFT (ms):                          6482.41   \r\nMedian TTFT (ms):                        6491.27   \r\nP99 TTFT (ms):                           11343.28  \r\n-----Time per Output Token (excl. 1st token)------\r\nMean TPOT (ms):                          117.18    \r\nMedian TPOT (ms):                        117.11    \r\nP99 TPOT (ms):                           192.64    \r\n---------------Inter-token Latency----------------\r\nMean ITL (ms):                           117.18    \r\nMedian ITL (ms):                         43.08     \r\nP99 ITL (ms):                            1401.23 \r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nhumming-kernels 0.1.13\r\n```\r\n============ Serving Benchmark Result ============\r\nSuccessful requests:                     128       \r\nFailed requests:                         0         \r\nBenchmark duration (s):                  13.35     \r\nTotal input tokens:                      131072    \r\nTotal generated tokens:                  8192      \r\nRequest throughput (req/s):              9.59      \r\nOutput token throughput (tok/s):         613.52    \r\nPeak output token throughput (tok/s):    3968.00   \r\nPeak concurrent requests:                128.00    \r\nTotal token throughput (tok/s):          10429.91  \r\n---------------Time to First Token----------------\r\nMean TTFT (ms):                          6494.01   \r\nMedian TTFT (ms):                        6513.82   \r\nP99 TTFT (ms):                           11363.66  \r\n-----Time per Output Token (excl. 1st token)------\r\nMean TPOT (ms):                          107.61    \r\nMedian TPOT (ms):                        107.46    \r\nP99 TPOT (ms):                           183.73    \r\n---------------Inter-token Latency----------------\r\nMean ITL (ms):                           107.61    \r\nMedian ITL (ms):                         32.83     \r\nP99 ITL (ms):                            1400.98   \r\n==================================================\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [ ] The purpose of the PR, such as \"Fix some issue (link existing issues this PR will resolve)\".\r\n- [ ] The test plan, such as providing test command.\r\n- [ ] The test results, such as pasting the results comparison before and after, or e2e results\r\n- [ ] (Optional) The necessary documentation update, such as updating `supported_models.md` and `examples` for a new model.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n**BEFORE SUBMITTING, PLEASE READ <https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/contributing>** (anything written below this line will be removed by GitHub Actions)\r\n",
